{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201230","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1820123001:0":{"text":"サベリン、久しぶりじゃねえか！","source_cn":"莎柏琳，好久不见啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF38656F8688679BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820123002:1":{"text":"最近何してたんだ？こっちはどうも頭が回らなくてな。","source_cn":"你最近都忙什么呢？真让我摸不着头脑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B2B31CC75D7B0AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820123003:0":{"text":"それで、余計に考えて……考えて……考えた挙句に――ふと思ったんだ。あれ？なんか首元がスースーするぞ？ってな。","source_cn":"然后我想啊想啊，想啊想啊——这时候，我突然发现，我的脖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDFFA7E3F225974C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820123004:0":{"text":"そして恐る恐る、手を伸ばしたら……","source_cn":"往上一摸，我发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76454DA8A9D76BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820123005:1":{"text":"オレの頭、本当に取れてやんの！そりゃあ、<style=\"highlight\">頭も回らない</style>わな！ガッハッハ！","source_cn":"我的头真的掉了！这次，我是真的<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CDA96EB78E2CBE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820123006:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820123007:0":{"text":"驚いたか？そんなビビんなって！ほら、頭はちゃんとはめ直しただろ？","source_cn":"哈哈！吓到了吗？别这么胆小！我这不是把头安回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE65ECD26A68A2218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820123008:0":{"text":"ちょっと待て！おれの話も聞いてくれ！","source_cn":"等等！我也有，我也有笑话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C192C5BCB793C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820123009:0":{"text":"――ある日、おれは自分のすねの骨がなくなってることに気がついた。こりゃあ困った、スコフより背が低くなっちまう！","source_cn":"有一天，我发现我的小腿骨突然少了一节。这可麻烦了，我比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D68C71628329BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820123010:0":{"text":"そして、さらに問題がある。もし「そんなのスコフより背が低い言い訳だろ」なんて言われたら、おれはどうすればいい？","source_cn":"万一你们不相信我是因为这个才比死考夫矮的，以为我是在找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EA3598354E8184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820123011:0":{"text":"そこでおれは考えた。考えて……考えて……ある妙案を思いついた。","source_cn":"所以，我也想了个好办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AC83D5CEFD5440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820123012:0":{"text":"――そうだ、骸骨になればいい。でも困ったことに、元に戻れなくなっちまってな！","source_cn":"——那就是把自己变成骷髅！啊哈哈哈！可惜，我变不回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590796C559FFF107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820123013:0":{"text":"お嬢ちゃん、可哀そうだと思うだろ？だからあんたの皮膚と肉、少しばかり貸してくんねぇか？","source_cn":"你说，是不是很可惜？小姑娘，把你的皮肉借给我好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB3A8DCD7E04DE5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820123014:0":{"text":"<shk>き、君たちは……</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>你、你们——</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A01D6207491982E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820123015:0":{"text":"はいはい、おふざけはそこまでよ。この世ともう一度お別れしたいっていうなら、話は別だけど。","source_cn":"好了，不要再胡闹了。除非你们打算再次和世界永别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27396AAADF55845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820123016:0":{"text":"ご、ごめんって……真面目な顔したときのサベリンは怖すぎるんだよ……","source_cn":"好啦好啦……严肃起来的莎柏琳真可